# Agent scratch. Briefs ask agents to namespace their probes and verification
# builds under a short prefix; when the brief does not spell out the scratchpad
# path they land here instead. Transient either way -- probe scripts, preview
# logs and throwaway builds, not deliverables.
m[A-Z]/
.env*
